  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The cause of this event was that the V-belt vendor sent a different variant of the BX-99 V-belt ordered (Torq Titan vs. the Grip Notch V-belt expected) and these V-belts were inadvertently accepted and installed at the station. Contributing to this cause was that there were missed opportunities to recognize that the new V-belts were not the same design as the V-belts being replaced.",
    "cause_code": "TBD",
    "category": "provisional",
    "theme": "vendor substitution of replacement part not caught by receipt inspection",
    "provisional": true
